lass=\"lucide lucide-check w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">API access</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Integración con LMS</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Reportes personalizados</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Backup automático</span></li></ul><button class=\"w-full py-3 text-lg font-bold rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\n        bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-blue-500 hover:from-emerald-600 hover:to-blue-600\n        shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl text-white border-2 border-emerald-600\n        hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-95\" style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\"><rect width=\"32\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#635BFF\"></rect><path d=\"M23.5 16.5C23.5 19.5376 21.0376 22 18 22C14.9624 22 12.5 19.5376 12.5 16.5C12.5 13.4624 14.9624 11 18 11C21.0376 11 23.5 13.4624 23.5 16.5Z\" fill=\"white\"></path></svg>Comprar ahora con Stripe</button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-20\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">¿Por qué elegir <!-- -->Loopaas<!-- -->?</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Nuestra plataforma está diseñada específicamente para instituciones educativas modernas que buscan optimizar sus procesos de evaluación.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bar-chart3 w-8 h-8 text-white\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">Análisis Avanzado</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">Obtén insights profundos sobre el rendimiento de tus estudiantes con dashboards interactivos y reportes detallados.</p></div><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-8 h-8 text-white\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">Seguridad Empresarial</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">Protección de datos de nivel empresarial con encriptación end-to-end y cumplimiento de estándares educativos.</p></div><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap w-8 h-8 text-white\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">Integración Rápida</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">Conecta con tu LMS existente en minutos. Compatible con Canvas, Moodle, Blackboard y más.</p></div><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock w-8 h-8 text-white\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">Ahorro de Tiempo</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">Automatiza evaluaciones y reduce el tiempo de corrección hasta en un 80% con nuestros plugins inteligentes.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-lg mb-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white text-center mb-8\">Preguntas Frecuentes</h2><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2\">¿Puedo cambiar de plan en cualquier momento?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">Sí, puedes actualizar o degradar tu plan en cualquier momento desde tu panel de administración. Los cambios se aplican inmediatamente.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2\">¿Qué incluye la prueba gratuita?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">La prueba de 14 días incluye acceso completo al plan Pro sin restricciones. No se requiere tarjeta de crédito.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2\">¿Hay descuentos para instituciones educativas?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">Ofrecemos descuentos especiales para universidades y colegios. Contáctanos para obtener una cotización personalizada.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2\">¿Qué soporte técnico incluye cada plan?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">El plan Free incluye soporte por email. El plan Pro incluye soporte prioritario con chat en vivo y llamadas programadas.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-blue-600 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-white\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">¿Listo para transformar tu institución educativa?</h2><p class=\"text-xl mb-8 opacity-90\">Únete a miles de educadores que ya están usando <!-- -->Loopaas<!-- --> para mejorar sus procesos de evaluación.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-11 rounded-md bg-white text-emerald-600 hover:bg-gray-100 text-lg px-8\">Comenzar gratis</button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border h-11 rounded-md border-white/80 text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-emerald-600 bg-transparent backdrop-blur-sm text-lg px-8 transition-all duration-200\">Iniciar sesión</button></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-12 space-x-6\"><a class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:underline font-medium\" href=\"/\">← Volver a la landing</a><span class=\"text-gray-300\">•</span><a class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:underline font-medium\" href=\"/organizaciones\">Ver mis organizaciones</a></div></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications (F8)\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"pointer-events:none\"><ol tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"fixed top-[80%] z-[100] left-0 md:left-[40%] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"></ol></div><footer class=\"w-full border-t border-t-foreground/10 p-8 flex flex-col gap-4 justify-center text-center text-xs\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 hover:text-accent-foreground fixed bottom-4 right-4 z-50 rounded-full w-12 h-12 p-0 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white shadow-lg\" title=\"Translate to English\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><p>Hecho con ❤️ por<!-- --> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/eanorambuena/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"font-bold hover:underline\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-translate=\"no\">Emmanuel Norambuena</a></p><p>Si tienes algún problema, por favor<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:soporte.idsapp@gmail.com\" class=\"font-bold hover:underline\">contáctanos a <span class=\"text-emerald-700\" data-translate=\"no\">soporte.idsapp@gmail.com</span></a></p></div></footer></section></main><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-03d39388decbaeac.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[80811,[\\\"5730\\\",\\\"static/chunks/44530001-ad86ecd83cf8b35b.js\\\",\\\"4277\\\",\\\"static/chunks/4277-eb45f09a29f49c87.js\\\",\\\"6874\\\",\\\"static/chunks/6874-61b4c5756db3a422.js\\\",\\\"1840\\\",\\\"static/chunks/1840-513dcae355ffa03f.js\\\",\\\"8740\\\",\\\"static/chunks/8740-ca2ad053ae8552bd.js\\\",\\\"4765\\\",\\\"static/chunks/4765-c6b581bc363c8e08.js\\\",\\\"6747\\\",\\\"static/chunks/6747-9c8db04055c34d0e.js\\\",\\\"5293\\\",\\\"static/chunks/5293-2ccc131d3e91269